  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wadi Gaza Coastal Wetland Conservation Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting natural resources and safeguarding the environment. The project aims to protect public health of the Gaza Stip and its natural resources through restoration and rehabilitation of Wadi Gaza as a recognized natural reserve and coastal wetland. The project will enhance the livelihood of residents of surrounding towns though development of recreational facilities and creating job opportunities through the planned project activities.</narrative>
  </description>
